 Command line input:
 $ /opt/crest/crest bh4.xyz -qcg methanol.xyz -grow -nsolv 3 -alpb methanol -chrg -1 -fixsolute -T 4 -keepdir

  --alpb methanol : implicit solvation
  -chrg -1
  -T 4 (CPUs/Threads selected)

